\captionsetup{labelformat=empty}
\caption{Figure 1.1 A two-column "ID check" graphic titled 'Is it a DEFINING property of life?'. Left column FAILS (red): Growth - crossed out, caption "non-living things also grow (sand dune, crystal) by external accumulation"; Reproduction - crossed out, caption "many living things don't reproduce (mule, worker bee, infertile couple)". Right col- umn PASSES (green): Metabolism - tick, caption "all living things, no exception"; Cellular organisation - tick; Consciousness / response to stimuli - tick, caption "the defining property". A small inset shows a test tube labelled "isolated metabolic reac- tion = neither living nor non-living".}
\end{figure}

