\captionsetup{labelformat=empty}
\caption{Figure 1.2 A single brinjal plant at the centre, with five labelled speech-bubbles around it showing the regional names (begun, kathirikai, vangi, brinjal, eggplant); a single arrow from all of them converging onto one banner reading "Solanum mel- ongena" to visually show many local names →one universal scientific name.}
